              <content>
                <p>After “Schedule 1”, insert “to the regulations”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2">
              <num>2</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 12(a)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “column 1 of”, insert “the table in”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3">
              <num>3</num>
              <heading>Paragraphs 12(a) to (e)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “Schedule 1”, insert “to the regulations”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4">
              <num>4</num>
              <heading>Paragraphs 14(1)(c) to (g)</heading>
